flowchart LR
  A[research_candidate] --> B{Structural checks}
  B -->|pass| C{Neighbor distinctness}
  B -->|fail| X[Hold]
  C -->|pending or fail| X
  C -->|pass| D{Cross-context review}
  D -->|pending or fail| X
  D -->|pass or not applicable with evidence| E{Empirical validation}
  E -->|not run or fail| X
  E -->|pass with evidence| F[Future authority decision]
  F -. not performed in this run .-> G[Production promotion]
